</span>: I see your grades are excellent. Your instructors are very happy with your work.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes. Cooking is my passion. I need to get more work experience now.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Restaurant Manager</span>: You are in the right place! Do you have any questions about the job?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What's the difference between a sous-chef and a line cook?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Restaurant Manager</span>: The line cook preps the ingredients. The sous-chef reports to the chef and plans the menus.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That sounds exciting!<br/>", "time": "15000"}, {"image": "engenn4le18ob03re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-130\">Restaurant Manager</span>: It is. You have to improvise sometimes. You also need to deal with pressure. Is your schedule flexible?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Restaurant Manager</span>: Perfect. I can let you know tomorrow.", "time": "42000"}], "coverimg": "engenn4le18ob03re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}]}